1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,013
Zinc is a bluish white metal, brittle when cold, malleable between one hundred and one hundred and fifty degrees, so zinc sheet is rolled hot.

2
00:00:10,013 --> 00:00:16,302
Its most asked property: it dissolves in acids and in alkalis, both with hydrogen.

3
00:00:16,302 --> 00:00:19,804
In hydrochloric acid it gives zinc chloride.

4
00:00:19,804 --> 00:00:23,567
In hot sodium hydroxide it gives sodium zincate.

5
00:00:23,567 --> 00:00:25,742
Zinc is amphoteric.

